{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"京都にて全国握手会がありました！\nペアはりんごさん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/miria.watanabe/img/miria.watanabe/img/2015/03/22/2247962/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お揃いのツインテールにしたの♡\nネイルもちなみにお揃いにしたんだー♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"透明だけどね...笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/miria.watanabe/img/miria.watanabe/img/2015/03/22/2247962/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"りんごさんのファンの方々も\n優しくて楽しく握手が出来ました。\nずーっとテンション高かったなぁ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとうございました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/miria.watanabe/img/miria.watanabe/img/2015/03/22/2247962/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かなさん安定ですいつも♡笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/miria.watanabe/img/miria.watanabe/img/2015/03/22/2247962/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ホテルはいおりんぬと相部屋でした"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いろいろとお話しして楽しかった〜\nいおりんぬが寝てる上に\n乗っかってふざけたり、、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最後は一緒のベッドで寝ました♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いおりんぬとはホテルの相部屋が\n多い気がする。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そういえば握手会のときに\n絢音ちゃんが見せてくれました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/miria.watanabe/img/miria.watanabe/img/2015/03/22/2247962/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"秋田の切符、なんと見事な...！\nレアだ！と思って撮っちゃいました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いろんな発見が出来ました(^ ^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして今日はチェキ会！多忙‼︎"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/miria.watanabe/img/miria.watanabe/img/2015/03/22/2247962/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たくさん撮りました〜\nチェキ会楽しかったな〜\nでもあんまり話せなかったのが残念..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/miria.watanabe/img/miria.watanabe/img/2015/03/22/2247962/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"同じ部だった白石さんと♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たくさんの方が来てくれて嬉しき‼︎\nありがとうございました〜♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一緒に撮ったやつ見たいなぁ\n今度握手会とかに持ってきてね！笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/miria.watanabe/img/miria.watanabe/img/2015/03/22/2247962/0007.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ふぁっさふぁっさ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こないだ外が暖かかったので\n久しぶりに私の大好きな親友と\nお出掛けしてきました〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"インドア脱出。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こないだ言ってたスニーカー探し！\nお金が足りなくて買えなかった(>_<)\nあと205円...205円あれば...買えた..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"悔しかったけど美味しいクレープ\n食べてすぐに元気が出ました。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/miria.watanabe/img/miria.watanabe/img/2015/03/22/2247962/0008.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私歩くのとか走るの好きだから\nカフェでまったり♪というよりかは\nいろんな雑貨や服を見ながら\n歩く方が好きです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"歩いていろんな裏道回ったりして\n見ているといろんな発見が出来るし\n可愛いお店なども見つけられるし\n最高や〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/miria.watanabe/img/miria.watanabe/img/2015/03/22/2247962/0009.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たまにはこういう息抜きもいいですね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みりり委員会と誕生日は次回！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"【朗報】"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"公式プロフィールには身長が\n151cmと書いてありますが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんと"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"152cm"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"に"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なりました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(((o(*ﾟ▽ﾟ*)o)))伸びたぞ(((o(*ﾟ▽ﾟ*)o)))"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それではまた見てね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みり愛"}],"source":"archive"}